# AUDITED SMOKE of levers D2a and D2c (the drafter conv I/O and head copies), run before that lever's timing pair: c2-packed-tp4-best-gate-d2 is c2-packed-tp4-best-gate (every verify audit on, the quad, the fused commit and the five
# verify-glue levers with their audits) plus EXACTLY QWEN_FAST_TP4_DRAFT_CONV=1, QWEN_FAST_TP4_DRAFT_HEADS=1, QWEN_FAST_TP4_DRAFT_CONV_AUDIT=1 and QWEN_FAST_TP4_DRAFT_HEADS_AUDIT=1. Inside each drafter bucket's capture (the first two buckets of each site) every engaged drafter conv also runs the served I/O kernel and every head split/merge the served ops, on the same operands, and the pairs are byte-compared on every chip right after that bucket's own replays ('[PINDIAG] tp4 draft conv audit exact=True convs=N', '[PINDIAG] tp4 draft heads audit exact=True tensors=N'); the quad-against-singles audit (QWEN_FAST_DRAFT_SINGLES_AUDIT=all) and the T1 and T2 audits run too. The proposal-identity compare of the timed arms checks the same bytes end to end.
# Tests: warmup, coding, concurrent4 (four users, each compared with its solo run) and concurrent4_code_equal (four real-code prompts of 4k).
# Read: no audit mismatch line anywhere; the engine log shows '[PINDIAG] tp4 draft conv engaged', 'draft conv audit exact=True', 'draft heads audit exact=True' and '[PINDIAG] tp4 draft heads engaged' lines and no 'fell back' line; the smoke check passes (it fails an audited arm with no
# passing audit line). A FAIL or a hang here means SKIP the lever's timing pair.
# OPTIONAL: a failure does not stop the window (it decides whether the lever's pair runs). Duration (estimate): 45-90 min.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the four-card tp4/samp-draft window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/samp-draft and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The window's jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-samp-1 is the image B0 builds from the pushed tp4/samp-draft commit while production serves (it carries
# tp4_shard_argmax, tp4_draft_conv and tp4_draft_heads and their kernels, which are new); a later commit needs a new tag in every template.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-samp-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-best-gate-d2
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent4,concurrent4_code_equal
